 HISTORY                                                            75 1451
 -------                                                            75 1451
 This library was produced by the Low Energy Interaction Physics    75 1451
 (LEIP) group at NC State University, USA. The inelastic            75 1451
 scattering thermal scattering law data for UO2 were developed      75 1451
 using ab intio lattice dynamics methods [1,2]. The Full Law        75 1451
 Analysis Scattering System Hub (FLASSH) code was used to           75 1451
 produce File 7 MT=2 and 4 for U in UO2 and O in UO2 [3]. MAT=48    75 1451
 and ZA=148 were used for natural U in UO2.                         75 1451
                                                                    75 1451
 The UO2 evaluation was improved over the ENDF/B-VIII.0             75 1451
 evaluation with key updates: (1) lattice constants from            75 1451
 experimental values were used [2] and (2) the coherent elastic     75 1451
 (MT2) contribution was updated to the cubic evaluation in          75 1451
 FLASSH [3].                                                        75 1451
